{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好啦～大、大家都回到自己的座位……」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0079", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么，开始本周的大班会吧」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0080", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "本周的大班会是在第六节课。", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "万智老师来了，\\n我和濑名同学也一起站在了最前头。", "text_idx": 190, "plain": "万智老师来了，我和濑名同学也一起站在了最前头。", "plain_idx": 191, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "作为班委，我们要辅助老师组织班会。", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%51;「和新吾一起站在前面……\\n　好嘞，加油吧，加油万智」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": "%51;「和新吾一起站在前面……　好嘞，加油吧，加油万智」", "plain_idx": 194, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0081", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今、今天的议题呢，首先是关于考试」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0082", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。如大家所知，期中考试即将来临」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": "「嗯。如大家所知，期中考试即将来临」", "plain_idx": 199, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0265", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0083", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学率先发言。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在班委会时我就这么想过了，\\n她这种性格作为搭档真的很可靠。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": "在班委会时我就这么想过了，她这种性格作为搭档真的很可靠。", "plain_idx": 205, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「从下下周二，也就是２７号开始，将持续四天。\\n　虽然受到临时并校的影响，环境和考试时间都\\n　发生了变化——」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": "「从下下周二，也就是２７号开始，将持续四天。　虽然受到临时并校的影响，环境和考试时间都　发生了变化——」", "plain_idx": 207, "len": 56, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0266", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但我们作为结女校选出的代表，\\n　不能让成绩下降」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": "「但我们作为结女校选出的代表，　不能让成绩下降」", "plain_idx": 210, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0267", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「紧绷神经，努力学习吧」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0268", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "通用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔～」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "全体结女校学生", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "go031", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜呜，全都让濑名同学说完了……\\n　不，应该说她比我还用心……唉」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "「呜呜，全都让濑名同学说完了……　不，应该说她比我还用心……唉」", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0084", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0269", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……当然，我们也要为各务台学院争面子。\\n　为了不拖后腿，大伙可要好好学习」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": "「嗯……当然，我们也要为各务台学院争面子。　为了不拖后腿，大伙可要好好学习」", "plain_idx": 224, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也急忙接过了话。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学都率先冲锋了，\\n那我也得紧随其后。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": "濑名同学都率先冲锋了，那我也得紧随其后。", "plain_idx": 227, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不过，说是这么说，\\n　其实我自己完全没什么自信。应该没问题吧」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": "「……不过，说是这么说，　其实我自己完全没什么自信。应该没问题吧」", "plain_idx": 229, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "由于濑名同学讲得一直都很认真，\\n我最后试着开了个玩笑。", "text_idx": 230, "plain": "由于濑名同学讲得一直都很认真，我最后试着开了个玩笑。", "plain_idx": 231, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家似乎听进去了，我暂时松了一口气。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，不过，我会努力的。也请大家多多指教」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，新吾……我也会加油的……！」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0085", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咱们班两个班委都非常可靠，\\n　老师很放心！」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": "「咱们班两个班委都非常可靠，　老师很放心！」", "plain_idx": 237, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0086", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「万智老师也要努力工作哦～」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0057", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只有您一个人悠闲自在呢～」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0208", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0270", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之，即使期中考试快要到了，我也只能\\n一件一件地去做我要做的事情。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": "总之，即使期中考试快要到了，我也只能一件一件地去做我要做的事情。", "plain_idx": 250, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「焚化炉在这边」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0271", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后，依然要和濑名同学做班委的工作。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……哎呀，没想到连“代替缺席的同学值日做打扫”\\n这种工作，也是班委去做。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "……哎呀，没想到连“代替缺席的同学值日做打扫”这种工作，也是班委去做。", "plain_idx": 255, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还是说，是濑名同学自愿承担了这项工作？", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……有事吗？」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0272", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，没事没事……感觉和之前完全颠倒了啊。\\n　现在反而是我要濑名同学带路了」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": "「啊，没事没事……感觉和之前完全颠倒了啊。　现在反而是我要濑名同学带路了」", "plain_idx": 260, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在熟悉的地方我可不会迷路的。\\n　那个时候是个例外，不要再提那件事了」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": "「在熟悉的地方我可不会迷路的。　那个时候是个例外，不要再提那件事了」", "plain_idx": 262, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0273", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，不过谢谢你带路，真是帮我大忙了」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我还是先笑着对她道了谢。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我已经对校内情况有了大致的了解，\\n但还不知道焚化炉的位置，所以还是得让人带路。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": "虽然我已经对校内情况有了大致的了解，但还不知道焚化炉的位置，所以还是得让人带路。", "plain_idx": 267, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……这也算我的工作」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0274", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名移开视线，冷冷地说道。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我不喜欢那种无缘无故就笑起来的人」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0275", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你已经知道地方了吧，我先回去了。\\n　还有其他的工作要做」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "「你已经知道地方了吧，我先回去了。　还有其他的工作要做」", "plain_idx": 275, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0276", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她板着脸快步离去了。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哎呀呀」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我有意识地耸了耸肩膀。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那么，快点把垃圾丢掉，去和濑名同学会合吧……", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "清扫工作结束后，就该处理文件了。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在无人的教室里，\\n濑名同学和我留了下来，面对面地认真处理着工作。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": "在无人的教室里，濑名同学和我留了下来，面对面地认真处理着工作。", "plain_idx": 283, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管做多少，工作都没有减少啊……」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为咱们班采用了前所未有的形式，\\n　刚开始的时候忙点也没办法」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "「因为咱们班采用了前所未有的形式，　刚开始的时候忙点也没办法」", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0277", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "回答问题的时候，濑名同学的手也没有停下来。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不对，倒不如说伴随着回答，她处理工作的速度好像也变得越来越快了。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "笔尖以极快的速度移动着，不知不觉中，\\n濑名同学已经完成了数倍于我的工作量。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": "笔尖以极快的速度移动着，不知不觉中，濑名同学已经完成了数倍于我的工作量。", "plain_idx": 291, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说是这么说，但是到了期中应该也会稍微歇一下吧。\\n　要是给学生带来那么大的负担，那可就本末倒置了」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": "「说是这么说，但是到了期中应该也会稍微歇一下吧。　要是给学生带来那么大的负担，那可就本末倒置了」", "plain_idx": 293, "len": 50, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0278", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……那也就是说，本周就会先告一段落了吗？」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "确实，学校那边，\\n也应该希望在考试前让学生专注于学习。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": "确实，学校那边，也应该希望在考试前让学生专注于学习。", "plain_idx": 297, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……要是不这样就困扰了啊」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0279", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在那低语般的回答之后，\\n濑名同学闭上了嘴，而我也默不作声。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": "在那低语般的回答之后，濑名同学闭上了嘴，而我也默不作声。", "plain_idx": 301, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「结束了」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0280", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生还在干呢，那不好意思，我先走了」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0281", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后不出所料，她比我更早完成了工作，\\n像往常一样说着“我先走了”后就离开了。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": "然后不出所料，她比我更早完成了工作，像往常一样说着“我先走了”后就离开了。", "plain_idx": 307, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
